6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rC-xqjedfocQ7kNvwGiwWDE&_nc_oc=Adqk31Je9p3Us1je8wM5pmj5mCPlMQkVKnRJbIxBger32cV3fRO9rcmUQi3EKEhZAFg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJuDFDFQgCnHnVcCUZIjM8OW5kFfVDGNrrKQlR0XBgA2A&oe=6AAABD90"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Clonk Key Art.png", "id": "2072590033165395", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825034_2072590039832061_2045682752211280299_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S8mWwCnjMTAQ7kNvwEPfOrN&_nc_oc=AdrEifBPLhmT7LyR26H9cGh4OZLKHtXOT-mtwBH1HbPM6i98wqjsPRwquuV171Wrd2M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLTjkopxaLg4zE3lUS5F9DmoifBEjBtnq0tutIkRCl82Q&oe=6AAA97C0"}, "display_name": "Clonk", "keywords": ["Racing", "Hangout", "Platformer", "Shooter", "Action"], "long_description": "# NEW UPDATE: CLONKBALL \u26bd\ud83d\udd2b\n**Shoot the ball. Bend the shot. Score the goal.**\n\nClonkBall is chaotic team gameplay where your weapons control the ball\u2014angle your shots, add spin, and pull off ridiculous plays. Earn currency each round and grab new weapons mid-match to turn things in your favor. Fast, competitive, and a little bit unhinged.\n\n{1936839123641608}\n\n**Move Different. Play Different.**\nSwing your arms to run. Triple jump through the air. Climb anything made of yellow clay. Fire oversized weapons and cause absolute chaos.\n\n{1638761550598742}\n\n**More Ways to Clonk**\n\ud83c\udfc1 Race modes with high-speed parkour\n\ud83d\udca5 Arena fights where anything goes\n\ud83c\udf00 Social hubs to hang out, explore, and mess around with friends\n\nJoin the Community\nJump into the Discord for events, updates, and everything else.\n\n**Prepare to get Clonked.**\n\n{824791767332742}\n\n", "short_description": "A chaotic free to play VR party game with wild movement, gadgets, and social game modes.\nJump into Early Access, help us test new updates, and earn exclusive rewards!"}]}, "developer_name": " Bea